 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Fixed
+
+- Local-only patch: semantic `find` reports all-failed judge requests as failures with their provider causes, rather than claiming there were no hits; JSON CLI failures also explain their nonzero exit on stderr.
+- Local-only patch: `find.credentialProvider` isolates calibrated CLI and agent-tool find judgments, authentication headers, rejection cooldowns and cached answers from the shared judge provider; missing or rejected dedicated credentials never use the shared account or a prompted session fallback.
+
 ## [18.4.12] - 2026-10-02
 
 ### Added
